#: Modals/standaloneexecutable.md:2
msgid "--standalone-executable option"
msgstr "--standalone-executable オプション"

#: Modals/standaloneexecutable.md:9
msgid ""
"The path to the PLUMED root directory is hard coded in the plumed executable"
" as can be verified by using the command:"
msgstr "Root Directory の Path は実行ファイルに固定されており、次で確認できます。"

#: Modals/standaloneexecutable.md:19
msgid ""
"You can force plumed to ignore this error and to run anyway by using the "
"option --standalone-executable as shown below"
msgstr "次の --standalone-executable でエラーを無視して実行できます。"

#: Modals/standaloneexecutable.md:23
msgid ""
"Many features are not be available if you run in this way. This is currently"
" the only way to use the PLUMED static executable on Windows, however."
msgstr "多くの機能が使えなくなりますが、Windows で Static 実行ファイルを使う現在唯一の方法です。"
